TEXT 536 200 Left 2 !.tran {Tstop}
TEXT 248 248 Left 2 !.param fs 200k\n.param Ts =1/fs\n.step param Duty list 0.3 0.4 0.5 0.773 ;.param Duty 0.3;\n.param Ton1 Duty*Ts\n.param Ton2 Ts-Ton1\n.param Tr 1n\n.param Tf 1n\n.param Tstart 9m\n.param Tstop 10m\n.param Tdel=50n
TEXT 256 528 Left 2 !.model MyDiode D(Ron=0.001 Roff=100Meg Vfwd=0)\n.model MySwitch SW (Ron=0.001 Roff=100Meg Vt=1)\n.model LED D(IS=1E-15 N=3.48 RS=0.5)
